<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan sells over 1bln rupees' bonds.</title>
<headline>Pakistan sells over 1bln rupees' bonds.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan auctioned short-term federal bonds worth a total of 1.075 billion rupees in its weekly open market operation on Wednesday:</p>
<p>			 Offered	  Accepted	  Max. cut-off</p>
<p>Outright sale	  575		575	     16.00 pct</p>
<p>one-month		nil		nil		     nil</p>
<p>Three-month	    nil		nil		     nil</p>
<p>Five-month	   1,000		500	     15.90 pct</p>
<p>Total (million rupees) 1,575	    1,075</p>
<p>($1 = 40.62 rupees) -- Ovais Subhani 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
